        "shipping": {
          "type": "pq-policy-category",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping",
            "anchor": "shipping"
          },
          "blocks": {
            "shipping_1": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "Where do you currently ship?",
                "answer": "<p>We ship to supported destinations in the United States, Europe and Asia. Enter your address at checkout to confirm availability. Orders are fulfilled from China and confirmed operational facilities.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_2": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "When will my order be dispatched?",
                "answer": "<p>In-stock orders are normally prepared for dispatch within three business days after payment confirmation and required checks. For China-origin shipments, orders received after 5 p.m. China Standard Time generally begin processing the next business day.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_3": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "Which shipping carriers do you use?",
                "answer": "<p>Depending on the order and destination, Panquire may use UPS, FedEx or another suitable carrier. Motorcycles and oversized orders may require a specialized freight service.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_4": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "What delivery timing applies?",
                "answer": "<p>Eligible orders to supported U.S. and European destinations are guaranteed delivery within 30 calendar days after the carrier physically accepts the shipment. Order processing before carrier acceptance is separate. Check eligibility before payment. Delivery estimates for other supported destinations are shown at checkout. The <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a> explains the eligible destinations, timing and remedies for delayed orders. Preorders and backorders may have separately agreed dates.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_5": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "What if my delivery is late or missing?",
                "answer": "<p>Contact <a href=\"mailto:support@panquire.com\">support@panquire.com</a> with your order number and tracking information. For an eligible order that misses its guarantee, you may cancel the undelivered order for a full refund or agree to a revised date. See the <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping Policy</a> for the full terms.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_6": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "Will I receive tracking information?",
                "answer": "<p>Panquire sends shipping confirmation and tracking details when available. Freight shipments may use different tracking or delivery appointment procedures.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_7": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "What should I do if my order arrives damaged?",
                "answer": "<p>Contact Panquire promptly. Include your order number, tracking details and photos of the product, packaging and labels where available. Keep the packaging if safe. A suggested reporting period does not limit your legal rights.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_8": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "How are shipping fees and free shipping determined?",
                "answer": "<p>Free outbound shipping to supported destinations is included in the product price. No separate standard shipping fee is added at checkout. Duties and taxes may apply separately. Return shipping is governed by the Return &amp; Refund Policy.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            },
            "shipping_9": {
              "type": "pq-policy-question",
              "settings": {
                "question": "How are lithium-ion batteries shipped?",
                "answer": "<p>Battery shipments may require special packaging, documentation or transport. If a battery is damaged, leaking, swollen or otherwise unsafe, contact Panquire for handling and collection instructions before shipping it.</p>"
              },
              "blocks": {}
            }
          },
